{"id":"n29749-5-10","stage":1,"title":"나누다 · 分享","scene":"重逢与闲聊","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n29749-5-10-1","ko":"아, 승규 씨 오랜만입니다!","zh":"啊，承奎先生，好久不见啦！","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아,","meaning":"啊、哦","explanation":"아：认出久违的人时发出的感叹，相当于“啊、哦”。","readings":[{"term":"아","audio":"/audio/d6ce479be9ddc9b7de97.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16247","senseId":"4","lemma":"아","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아","audio":"/audio/d6ce479be9ddc9b7de97.mp3"}},{"text":"승규","meaning":"承奎","explanation":"승규：承奎。","readings":[{"term":"승규","audio":"/audio/20c7bbd00a1a5f26d499.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"승규","audio":"/audio/20c7bbd00a1a5f26d499.mp3"}},{"text":"씨","meaning":"用于称呼或指称前面的人，表示尊敬。","explanation":"씨：用于称呼或指称前面的人，表示尊敬。","readings":[{"term":"씨","audio":"/audio/c90eea3c6347f1e0f4d9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58145","senseId":"1","lemma":"씨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"씨","audio":"/audio/c90eea3c6347f1e0f4d9.mp3"}},{"text":"오랜만입니다!","meaning":"好久，久违","explanation":"오랜만：好久，久违；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；ㅂ니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"오랜만","audio":"/audio/2208566c28753d001fd8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68090","senseId":"1","lemma":"오랜만","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오랜만입니다","audio":"/audio/e41e4bde8e564a6018ea.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"d6ce479be9ddc9b7","term":"아","zh":"啊、哦","audio":"/audio/d6ce479be9ddc9b7de97.mp3","entryId":"16247","definition":"认出或看到对方时发出的感叹声。","pronunciation":["아"]},{"id":"c90eea3c6347f1e0","term":"씨","zh":"用于称呼或指称前面的人，表示尊敬。","audio":"/audio/c90eea3c6347f1e0f4d9.mp3","entryId":"58145","definition":"用于称呼或指称前面的人，表示尊敬。","pronunciation":["씨"]},{"id":"2208566c28753d00","term":"오랜만","zh":"好久，久违","audio":"/audio/2208566c28753d001fd8.mp3","entryId":"68090","definition":"从有某事开始过了很长时间后。","pronunciation":["오랜만"]}],"audio":"/audio/85d00e97c51a2191a7c1.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n29749-5-10-2","ko":"네, 반갑습니다. 어디 가서 커피 한잔 나누며 잠시 이야기나 할까요?","zh":"嗯，很高兴见到您。我们去哪儿喝杯咖啡，边喝边聊一会儿吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네,","meaning":"嗯、是啊","explanation":"네：礼貌地回应对方的招呼。","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}},{"text":"반갑습니다.","meaning":"高兴，开心，喜悦","explanation":"반갑다：高兴，开心，喜悦；습니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"반갑다","audio":"/audio/d5cacddd111bc906da5c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70861","senseId":"1","lemma":"반갑다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"반갑습니다","audio":"/audio/0258ef96e9ab46cada62.mp3"}},{"text":"어디","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}},{"text":"가서","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"1","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가서","audio":"/audio/0a4296790d3f4b0e6e6b.mp3"}},{"text":"커피","meaning":"咖啡","explanation":"커피：咖啡。","readings":[{"term":"커피","audio":"/audio/a4215a3126661d523ba2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27372","senseId":"2","lemma":"커피","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"커피","audio":"/audio/a4215a3126661d523ba2.mp3"}},{"text":"한잔","meaning":"一杯","explanation":"한잔：一杯；这里指一起喝一杯咖啡。","readings":[{"term":"한잔","audio":"/audio/b94a4dfc6a50694d1d0d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72462","senseId":"1","lemma":"한잔","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"한잔","audio":"/audio/b94a4dfc6a50694d1d0d.mp3"}},{"text":"나누며","meaning":"分享、一起喝","explanation":"나누다：分享；커피 한잔 나누다 指一起喝杯咖啡。-며 表示与后面的聊天同时进行。","readings":[{"term":"나누다","audio":"/audio/8a88d2ae9895b06ef350.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29749","senseId":"5","lemma":"나누다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나누며","audio":"/audio/aa13c235298ad53ba943.mp3"}},{"text":"잠시","meaning":"片刻，暂时","explanation":"잠시：片刻，暂时。","readings":[{"term":"잠시","audio":"/audio/6fcdfa8c124ab5cbb197.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71203","senseId":"1","lemma":"잠시","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잠시","audio":"/audio/6fcdfa8c124ab5cbb197.mp3"}},{"text":"이야기나","meaning":"聊聊天","explanation":"이야기：谈话；-나 在这里表示随意做点事的语气，整组 이야기나 하다 是“聊聊天”。","readings":[{"term":"이야기","audio":"/audio/ffe0179e59e74069bc54.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60321","senseId":"2","lemma":"이야기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이야기나","audio":"/audio/4ea1c601dc0795073a1b.mp3"}},{"text":"할까요?","meaning":"聊一会儿吧？","explanation":"하다 与 이야기 合用表示“聊天”；-ㄹ까요? 礼貌地提议一起去聊聊。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"할까요","audio":"/audio/289dd8e3438eab1f235b.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"嗯、是啊","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"礼貌地肯定或回应别人；这里回应“好久不见”。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"d5cacddd111bc906","term":"반갑다","zh":"高兴，开心，喜悦","audio":"/audio/d5cacddd111bc906da5c.mp3","entryId":"70861","definition":"因见到想见的人或实现了愿望而感到欢喜愉快。","pronunciation":["반갑따"]},{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代不知道的处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"从一个地方移动到另一个地方。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"a4215a3126661d52","term":"커피","zh":"咖啡","audio"